The success summary line goes to stderr, never stdout: a no-op set prints no
diff on stdout yet still reports the summary on stderr and exits 0.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=backlog
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=backlog
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# Body
